0 243.12 340.32 243.12 340.32 0 3 0 0 DPLF
[     1 0 0    -1 0 243.12] CT
%%EndPageSetup
-0 -0 TX
1.00 LW
GS
0 0 TX
1418 1013 300 scaleImg
/DeviceRGB setcolorspace
